---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../lib/siteConfig";
---

<Layout title="Editorial Policy" description={`Editorial policy for ${siteConfig.name}.`} noIndex>
	<Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: "Editorial Policy" }]} />

	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Editorial Policy</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-neutral mt-8 max-w-none prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-ink prose-p:text-body prose-li:text-body dark:prose-invert">
			<p>
				At {siteConfig.name}, our editorial goal is to provide educational, accurate, and
				reader-focused financial content. We are committed to maintaining transparency, quality,
				and integrity in everything we publish.
			</p>
			<h2>Content standards</h2>
			<p>Every article published on {siteConfig.name} is created with the intention of:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Educating readers</li>
				<li>Simplifying financial concepts</li>
				<li>Providing practical insights</li>
				<li>Encouraging informed financial decisions</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>Research and accuracy</h2>
			<p>
				We strive to ensure that the information published on this website is accurate and up to
				date at the time of publication. Our content may reference RBI, SEBI, NSE, government
				publications, financial institutions, public financial data, and reputed news and
				educational sources. However, financial information can change over time, and we cannot
				guarantee complete accuracy at all times.
			</p>
			<h2>Editorial independence</h2>
			<p>
				{siteConfig.name} maintains editorial independence. Opinions expressed in articles belong
				to the respective authors and are not influenced by advertisers or external parties.
			</p>
			<h2>AI-assisted content</h2>
			<p>
				Some content may involve the use of AI-assisted tools for research support, structuring, or
				drafting purposes. All content is reviewed, edited, and refined before publication to
				ensure quality and relevance.
			</p>
			<h2>No financial advice</h2>
			<p>
				The content published on {siteConfig.name} is intended for informational and educational
				purposes only and should not be considered professional financial, investment, legal, or
				tax advice. Readers should consult certified professionals before making financial
				decisions.
			</p>
			<h2>Corrections policy</h2>
			<p>
				If any factual errors are identified, we aim to correct them promptly. For corrections or
				concerns, <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-primary">contact us</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
